build ITK. For which you need git and CMake.  Basically:\n\ngit clone git://itk.org/ITK.git\ncd ITK\ngit submodule update --init\ncd ..\nmkdir ITK-bin\ncd ITK-bin\ncmake ../ITK\nmake\nctest -R .\n\nThen it will start running tests and soon enough one will crash.",
